## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- `double plusdi = iADX(NULL,PERIOD_H1,50,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_PLUSDI,1)`
- `double minusdi = iADX(NULL,PERIOD_H1,50,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_MINUSDI,1)`
- `double sar = iSAR(NULL,PERIOD_H1,0.02,0.2,1)`
- LONG: plusdi > minusdi AND sar < iLow[1]
- DI-cross exit: monitor plusdi vs minusdi reversal each bar
- SL: 50 pips; TP: 50 pips (1:1 R/R), also test indicator exit
- P3 sweeps: ADX period (14/28/50), TP (50/75/100 pips vs indicator exit)

